WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,560
Not only can this fire rise,

2
00:00:02,560 --> 00:00:04,440
This house will be sturdier and warmer

3
00:00:04,440 --> 00:00:05,360
Stronger

4
00:00:05,360 --> 00:00:06,360
Fire roasted snow

5
00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:08,240
The more you bake it, the firmer it becomes. Mou Chuange

6
00:00:08,240 --> 00:00:09,440
Are you trying to coax us?

7
00:00:09,440 --> 00:00:10,360
Just look at it

8
00:00:10,640 --> 00:00:12,440
I'll let you see it with your own eyes tonight

9
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:13,720
What is water and fire?

10
00:00:13,720 --> 00:00:16,960
I can also give birth to a warm nest. I saw Brother Mou Chuan.

11
00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:21,680
Why did you leave a hole in the top? Is there no air leakage? This is not air leakage. This is a ventilation hole. Remember.

12
00:00:21,680 --> 00:00:23,120
Just live in this crazy house

13
00:00:23,120 --> 00:00:25,080
You must leave such a hole, this hole

14
00:00:25,080 --> 00:00:26,480
Just to let the scorching gas out of the house

15
00:00:26,480 --> 00:00:30,080
Let the fresh air from outside come in, and it will cause some burning and some breathing.

16
00:00:30,560 --> 00:00:31,720
Remember Brother Mou Chuan

17
00:00:31,720 --> 00:00:40,550
I will keep this Kong in my future life. Daddy, you are going to look crazy.

18
00:00:40,550 --> 00:00:42,550
Why is there ice on this snow wall?

19
00:00:42,550 --> 00:00:45,190
When the fire roasted it, it didn't melt but instead froze.
